            en: 'DRE is a share of all defects that ever existed — it must stay under 100% and complement the escape rate to 100 - DRE. The wrong denominator makes it a rocket with no ceiling the better you get: a removal efficiency of 900% is a number no metric can carry. You will meet this exact defect in today\u2019s debug block.',
