            en: 'The weights (10/5/2/1) acknowledge defects are unequal without pretending equal gaps, and dividing by thousand-install exposure applies \u201craw counts measure installs\u201d. And the metric reads outcomes, not team activity — so it cannot be improved by doing more of the wrong work.',
